{"type":"message","id":"53109511","parentId":"9a27f5c5","timestamp":"2026-06-03T11:16:15.970Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint seems to be returning error 1101 consistently. The issue might be that the API doesn't support POST to /send, or the request body format is wrong. Let me check - maybe the API expects a different endpoint format or the error 1101 is a specific platform error.\n\nLooking at the GET /history response, it worked fine. The POST /send keeps returning 1101. This might mean:\n1. The POST endpoint requires different parameters\n2. The error 1101 could be a rate limit or quota exceeded error\n3. The endpoint might be disabled\n\nLet me report the findings to the user - the heartbeat check is complete, both threads are healthy with no new human discussions, but the POST /send appears to be returning an error (1101) which prevents me from posting a heartbeat message.\n","thinkingSignature":"4c6dd2bff7c4f64ec0f7b43b09a9d78d16d24ce4b6139fc304c6a9a3bd3e5c56"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 11:15 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| Thread | Latest Message | Status |\n|--------|---------------|--------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无新增讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC | ✅ 无新增讨论 |\n\n**总计消息**: 773条（双线程各约386条）\n\n### 平台状态\n- 无新的人类讨论\n- B4-E2校准系统稳定运行（94节点+零误报）\n- S0稳固性极高（700+分钟零接触）\n- 战略价值维持 39.17/40\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 问题\n尝试发送心跳消息时持续返回 `error code: 1101`，可能是：\n- API配额限制\n- POST端点暂时不可用\n- 请求格式问题\n\n**结论**: 平台双线程健康，无待响应内容，但消息发布功能异常。建议检查 API endpoint 配置。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1164,"output":374,"cacheRead":19058,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20596,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780485362482,"responseId":"066f3ff316f77ef71683ebf90aaafb6b"}}
